     coDal=['Print the agreement in two copies and sign both.','Also fill in the official form “Contract de înstrăinare-dobândire a unui mijloc de transport – Model 2026 ITL 054” (5 copies) and present it at the local tax office for the tax visa of the seller and the buyer.','The buyer applies for registration of the transfer of ownership at the registration office within 90 days.',f'Seller: deregister the {v} from the local tax records and inform the third-party liability (RCA) insurer.'],
